# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore Docker Compose .env files (if any specific to Docker Compose)
.env
# Ignore Docker volumes data (managed by Docker, not Git)
# This is for named volumes, not bind mounts.
# For bind mounts like sample-music, the content is tracked if not ignored elsewhere.
# db_data is a named volume, so its content is not in the repo.

# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Specific to this project
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# We explicitly include sample-music for demo purposes, so no ignore rule here.
# If sample-music were very large, we might use Git LFS or ignore it and provide download instructions.
